From 9a07d40fc2048e7a34694b0c1b01e17c959da859 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:45:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/29] Battle digivolution: the HUD box itself grows a DP
 section

The party HUD box is one sprite (013B entry 0x4A). It is now drawn in slices
(POLY_FT4, as Gfx_DrawPartQuadsRot draws parts) 13 rows taller: the HP / MP
panel gets a third section like MP's with the panel's shaded bottom under it,
the left panel grows with plain rows above its own shaded bottom, and the name
strip moves down. The box is raised by as much, so the name strip and the name
stay where they were. The DP gauge is the game's own HP gauge parts drawn 26
rows lower; the label is "DP" in the HP label's letters and shadow. Replaces
the hand-drawn row under the box.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
